		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Wiry, violet-skinned beings with knobby head growths. Dwell in the Astral Plane, where they ride their magic surfboards across the endless void. Nomads.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15 (leather + shield), <strong>HP</strong> 9, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 trident (close/near) +2 (1d6) or 1 longbow (far) +0 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Astral Recoil</strong>. As an action, touch an Astral traveler's silver cord. WIS 15+ or they are snapped back into their body, ending their Astral trip.</p><p></p><p><strong>Disk Rider</strong>. Can summon a floating disk, which they fly upon. Cannot naturally fly.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
